The safeguard is due diligence beyond the demo or PowerPoint. Williams says to know the people, talk offline, meet their family or broader context, and understand character because no business plan goes flawlessly. A useful ladder is: $\text{deck}
\longrightarrow
\text{conversation}
\longrightarrow
\text{context}
\longrightarrow
\text{character}
\longrightarrow
\text{alignment}.$

